<%- include('partials/head') %><%- include('partials/nav') %><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow light-eyebrow">JOURNEY MASTERZ</div><h1><%= title %></h1><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <%= title %></div></div></section><section class="section wrap legal-copy"><% if(kind==='privacy'){ %><h2>Privacy overview</h2><p>When you submit a travel enquiry, we collect the details you provide, such as your name, phone number, email, travel preferences and message, so the travel team can respond.</p><p>Do not submit sensitive personal information in an enquiry. Customer enquiries are stored for follow-up and are not exposed through public API endpoints. Contact the business to request access or correction of information you submitted.</p><p>This starter website does not sell customer data or collect online payments. A production operator should review this policy against its actual business practices and applicable law before launch.</p><% }else{ %><h2>Travel arrangements</h2><p>All package descriptions on this website are sample planning templates unless confirmed in a written quote. Itineraries, hotels, transport, inclusions, exclusions, prices and availability must be confirmed before travel.</p><p>Travel conditions, seasonal openings, permits, registrations and pilgrimage access may change. Travellers should check official advisories and relevant requirements. No access, registration or darshan is guaranteed.</p><p>This website is enquiry-based and does not process online payments. Confirm any booking terms and payment arrangements directly with the business in a separate, written agreement.</p><% } %><p class="muted">This is starter policy content and should be reviewed for your business and jurisdiction before launch.</p></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
